# Turnout Designer (ctodesgn.c): every design type is designed, placed from
# the hotbar and compared with a REGRESSION block, so the geometry it builds
# (segments, paths, end points) is checked, not just that Ok closes.
# - A design that can't connect is refused and the dialog stays open.
# - A right-hand turnout mirrors the left.
# - A new design with the name of an existing turnout asks first
#   (MSG_TODSGN_REPLACE): No keeps the old definition and the dialog open,
#   Yes replaces it. It used to replace it without asking.
# - A frog number comes back unchanged when the dialog reopens. The Designer
#   converts it as angle = asin(1/N).
# MOUSE 8200 is the space key (C_TEXT | ' ' << 8), which ends a placement.
VERSION 13
DEMOINIT
ORIG 0.000 0.000 0.000
ROOMSIZE 60.000 x 80.000
SCALE HO
REDRAW
# Refused: a #10 frog can't reach 1.0 off the straight in 6.0
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Regular Turnout
PARAMETER turnout-designer anglemode 0
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len1 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len2 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_off2 1.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_ang2 10.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer manuf TestCo
PARAMETER turnout-designer desc1 Test Left
PARAMETER turnout-designer partno1 TL1
PARAMETER turnout-designer desc2 Test Right
PARAMETER turnout-designer partno2 TR1
PARAMETER turnout-designer ok
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer window shown
# Fixed: 10 degrees, 0.5 off the straight; left and right placed
PARAMETER turnout-designer anglemode 1
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len1 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len2 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_off2 0.500
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_ang2 10.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer ok
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer window hidden
HOTBARSELECT TestCo	Test Left	TL1
COMMAND TurnoutHotBar
MOUSE 2 5.000 3.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 3.000
MOUSE 8200 5.000 3.000
COMMAND Describe
HOTBARSELECT TestCo	Test Right	TR1
COMMAND TurnoutHotBar
MOUSE 2 5.000 9.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 9.000
MOUSE 8200 5.000 9.000
COMMAND Describe
# Same name again, No: the old definition stays, the dialog stays open
NOTICEANSWER second
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Regular Turnout
PARAMETER turnout-designer anglemode 1
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len1 8.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len2 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_off2 0.500
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_ang2 10.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer ok
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer window shown
PARAMETER turnout-designer cancel
HOTBARSELECT TestCo	Test Left	TL1
COMMAND TurnoutHotBar
MOUSE 2 5.000 15.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 15.000
MOUSE 8200 5.000 15.000
COMMAND Describe
# Yes: replaced, straight leg 8.0
NOTICEANSWER first
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Regular Turnout
PARAMETER turnout-designer anglemode 1
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len1 8.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len2 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_off2 0.500
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_ang2 10.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer ok
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer window hidden
HOTBARSELECT TestCo	Test Left	TL1
COMMAND TurnoutHotBar
MOUSE 2 5.000 21.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 21.000
MOUSE 8200 5.000 21.000
COMMAND Describe
# A #6 frog; reopened, the dialog shows #6 again
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Regular Turnout
PARAMETER turnout-designer anglemode 0
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len1 8.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_len2 8.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_off2 0.750
PARAMETER turnout-designer td_reg_ang2 6.000
PARAMETER turnout-designer manuf TestCo
PARAMETER turnout-designer desc1 FrogReg
PARAMETER turnout-designer partno1 F1
PARAMETER turnout-designer desc2 FrogRegR
PARAMETER turnout-designer partno2 F1R
PARAMETER turnout-designer ok
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer window hidden
HOTBARSELECT TestCo	FrogReg	F1
COMMAND TurnoutHotBar
MOUSE 2 5.000 27.000
MOUSE 4 5.000 27.000
MOUSE 8200 5.000 27.000
COMMAND Describe
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Regular Turnout
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer anglemode 0
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer td_reg_ang2 6.000
PARAMCHECK turnout-designer td_reg_off2 0.750
PARAMETER turnout-designer cancel
# Curved Turnout
CTURNOUT DESIGNER SHOW Curved Turnout
